{"video":"zn71CjfYEqA","lines":[{"t":[0,2],"en":"Shh."},{"t":[2,3.3],"en":"Don't excite him."},{"t":[3.3,4.5],"en":"Don't make him excitable."},{"t":[8.3,9.8],"en":"Welcome back, Stanley."},{"t":[9.8,11.7],"en":"Thank you, Michael."},{"t":[11.7,12.8],"en":"It's true."},{"t":[12.8,14.5],"en":"Around this office in the past,"},{"t":[14.5,16.5],"en":"I have been a little abrupt with people."},{"t":[16.5,18.2],"en":"Not maybe, yes or no."},{"t":[18.2,19.2],"en":"No way, uh-uh."},{"t":[19.2,20.6],"en":"Are you from another planet?"},{"t":[20.6,21.8],"en":"Boy, have you lost your mind?"},{"t":[21.8,23.3],"en":"'Cause I'll help you find it."},{"t":[23.3,25.2],"en":"If I stutter, I'm done."},{"t":[25.2,27.4],"en":"Goodbye."},{"t":[27.4,30.6],"en":"But the doctor said, \"If I can't find a new way"},{"t":[30.6,33.2],"en":"to relate more positively to my surroundings,"},{"t":[33.2,35.2],"en":"I'm going to die.\""},{"t":[35.2,37.2],"en":"Well, Stanley, we have turned this office"},{"t":[37.2,39.8],"en":"into an intensive care unit."},{"t":[39.8,43],"en":"You have no idea how intensively we care."},{"t":[43,44.9],"en":"And today, your only job is to get better."},{"t":[44.9,46.4],"en":"Ahem."},{"t":[46.4,49.5],"en":"Oh, and also, um, expense reports"},{"t":[49.5,51.5],"en":"are apparently due from last week."},{"t":[51.5,54.1],"en":"So if you want to be reimbursed."},{"t":[54.1,55.7],"en":"Welcome back."},{"t":[55.7,57],"en":"Nice. Welcome back, Stanley."},{"t":[57,58.4],"en":"Nice and gentle."},{"t":[58.4,59.3],"en":"Hi, Stanley."},{"t":[59.3,59.9],"en":"Hey, fellas."},{"t":[59.9,61.1],"en":"Thanks for the story."},{"t":[61.1,61.7],"en":"Come on."},{"t":[61.7,62.7],"en":"You're crushing his heart."},{"t":[62.7,63.2],"en":"You're going to kill him."},{"t":[63.2,65.4],"en":"You're going to kill him."},{"t":[65.4,66.1],"en":"Andy?"},{"t":[66.1,69.6],"en":"A throne for your highness."},{"t":[69.6,71.2],"en":"I'm not sitting in a wheelchair."},{"t":[71.2,71.9],"en":"No, no, no."},{"t":[71.9,72.5],"en":"No debate."},{"t":[72.5,73.8],"en":"You are going to sit in that wheelchair"},{"t":[73.8,76.7],"en":"until you are back on your feet."},{"t":[76.7,78.4],"en":"I'm going to die."},{"t":[78.4,83.5],"en":"So, Stanley Dogg, I have made for you"},{"t":[83.5,87.7],"en":"a mix of all my favorite India songs sung by me."},{"t":[87.7,90],"en":"That is lovely."},{"t":[90,91.9],"en":"What do you hear it?"},{"t":[91.9,95],"en":"Welcome back."},{"t":[95,96.3],"en":"Hey, Stanley."},{"t":[96.3,98.7],"en":"Let me know when you need to go to the bathroom."},{"t":[98.7,99.5],"en":"What?"},{"t":[99.5,101.2],"en":"Michael may be your bathroom buddy,"},{"t":[101.2,105.2],"en":"so that you don't have a heart attack on the, the, like,"},{"t":[105.2,106.6],"en":"crapper."},{"t":[106.6,109.4],"en":"I can go to the bathroom by myself."},{"t":[109.4,111.6],"en":"Oh, well, great."},{"t":[111.6,112.6],"en":"Right?"},{"t":[116.6,118.3],"en":"Well, then maybe I'll just go with you"},{"t":[118.3,121.6],"en":"so we can talk about stuff."},{"t":[121.6,123.4],"en":"Thank you, Kevin."},{"t":[129.1,130.8],"en":"Are you going to smile all day?"},{"t":[130.8,132],"en":"Mm-hmm."},{"t":[132,135.7],"en":"Everyone is being so nice to me."},{"t":[135.7,139],"en":"So why do I find it so annoying?"},{"t":[139,143.6],"en":"I've known Stanley for a very long time now."},{"t":[143.6,148.3],"en":"And when he was at the hospital, it was hard for me."},{"t":[148.3,151],"en":"His heavy breathing is comforting"},{"t":[151,154.1],"en":"like the sound of the ocean."},{"t":[154.1,157.2],"en":"Stanley, I have a big surprise for you."},{"t":[157.2,158.5],"en":"Michael, I don't think surprises"},{"t":[158.5,160.2],"en":"are what Stanley needs right now."},{"t":[160.2,161],"en":"It's OK."},{"t":[161,162.6],"en":"What's the surprise, Michael?"},{"t":[162.6,166],"en":"I have for you a portable defibrillator."},{"t":[166,166.7],"en":"Shocking, huh?"},{"t":[166.7,169.4],"en":"You should be very careful with that defibrillator."},{"t":[169.4,170.9],"en":"It is a defibrillator."},{"t":[170.9,171.7],"en":"I watch ER."},{"t":[171.7,173.9],"en":"Well, according to the Oxford English Dictionary,"},{"t":[173.9,176.9],"en":"the proper pronunciation is \"de-bifrilator.\""},{"t":[176.9,179.1],"en":"Actually, it's defibrillator."},{"t":[179.1,182.8],"en":"D-E-F-I-B."},{"t":[182.8,185.7],"en":"I came in 17th in the Scripps National Spelling Bee."},{"t":[185.7,188.4],"en":"I got out on the word \"wizzy wig.\""},{"t":[188.4,190],"en":"And then I gained 40 pounds."},{"t":[190,192.5],"en":"I am the de-bifrilator."},{"t":[192.5,193.9],"en":"It's defibrillator."},{"t":[193.9,195.7],"en":"I'll be Barack."},{"t":[195.7,196.5],"en":"Obama joke."},{"t":[196.5,197.4],"en":"Racism is dead."},{"t":[197.4,200.8],"en":"OK, so how do we-- OK, we turn it on like that."},{"t":[200.8,202],"en":"Whoa, you don't want to--"},{"t":[202,203.4],"en":"Hey, oh, here we go."},{"t":[203.4,204.3],"en":"I'll turn it on."},{"t":[204.3,204.9],"en":"Here we go."},{"t":[204.9,206],"en":"Who's my first victim?"},{"t":[206,207.3],"en":"Ah, clear!"},{"t":[207.3,208.3],"en":"Very dangerous."},{"t":[208.3,209.5],"en":"That's very dangerous."},{"t":[209.5,210.3],"en":"That's a lot of voltage."},{"t":[210.3,212.4],"en":"Oh, a lot of voltage, a lot of voltage."},{"t":[212.4,216.6],"en":"Oh, oh, oh, oh, ha, ha."},{"t":[216.6,219.5],"en":"Michael is totally unsuited to be safety officer."},{"t":[219.5,222.2],"en":"During Stanley's heart attack, he sat on his chest"},{"t":[222.2,226.4],"en":"and shoved things in his mouth."},{"t":[226.4,230.6],"en":"We'll probably lose one employee a month."},{"t":[230.6,232.6],"en":"I cannot wait to shake somebody's hand"},{"t":[232.6,236.2],"en":"and defibrillate them."},{"t":[236.2,238.5],"en":"I even have a catchphrase."},{"t":[238.5,242.4],"en":"You've been defibrillated?"},{"t":[242.4,243.4],"en":"Hey, Toby."},{"t":[243.4,243.9],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[243.9,245.1],"en":"Put her there."},{"t":[245.1,245.5],"en":"What?"},{"t":[245.5,247.1],"en":"Put her there."},{"t":[247.1,251.4],"en":"Let's just let pygons be pygons."},{"t":[251.4,254.5],"en":"Why are you smiling, laughing, weird?"},{"t":[254.5,256.6],"en":"I'm just excited about Jake."},{"t":[256.6,258.9],"en":"Be friends."},{"t":[258.9,261.4],"en":"Be friends."},{"t":[261.4,263.4],"en":"What was that?"},{"t":[263.4,264.3],"en":"Oh, come on."},{"t":[264.3,264.9],"en":"God."},{"t":[267.9,268.4],"en":"No."},{"t":[268.4,279.8],"en":"Oh, come on."},{"t":[279.8,288.7],"en":"Oh, come on."}]}
